    "created_at": "2016-10-05T10:58:34Z",
    "updated_at": "2016-10-05T10:58:34Z",
    "body": "I think to consider that we need answers to these questions:\n- What are the use cases?\n- What is the scope of GlobalSymbolRegistry? When JavaScript says shared by all realms, does that also mean realms that do not have synchronous access to each other? (That might be bad, although maybe it doesn't matter?)\n- What exactly would it mean to clone one?\n",
