    "created_at": "2016-10-05T13:26:57Z",
    "updated_at": "2016-10-05T13:26:57Z",
    "body": "I think that we should not support this. We already don't support many things (cloning objects with private data, cloning non-enumerable properties, cloning non-own properties). There's no reason to clone symbols, and it raises a bunch of tough questions.\n",
